== Std.Terminal (r3.88): ReadKey past the end of input stops the program
== with "end of input" (fault kind 18).
Use Std.Terminal

Main :
    First := ReadKey
    PutLn(First.Ch)
    Second := ReadKey
    PutLn(Second.Ch)
;
